<title>JAPAN: Yamaha to announce OEM deal with U.S. chip maker.</title>
<headline>Yamaha to announce OEM deal with U.S. chip maker.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Yamaha Corp said it plans to announce the signing of an original equipment manufacturing (OEM) contract with a U.S. chip manufacturer at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT) on Thursday.</p>
</text>
